---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Dual Wallet System — Xhavic"
  description="Two execution paths at the sequencer level. Instant Wallet for composable DeFi. Secure Wallet with 24-hour escrow, email alerts, and one-click revert."
>

  <!-- ============================================================
       1. HERO — bg-dark, heading-display, gold accent, flow diagram
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="bg-dark text-white py-24 md:py-36">
    <div class="container max-w-container-lg">
      <!-- Breadcrumb -->
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-400 mb-8" data-reveal>
        <a href="/protocol" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Protocol</a>
        <span class="text-gray-600">/</span>
        <span class="text-white font-medium">Dual Wallet System</span>
      </nav>

      <div class="grid-40-60 items-center">
        <!-- Left: Headline block -->
        <div data-reveal>
          <h1 class="heading-display mb-6 gradient-text-static leading-[0.95]">
            The Security of a Cold Wallet.<br/>The Safety of an Undo Button.
          </h1>
          <p class="prose-editorial-dark mb-10 max-w-2xl">
            Introducing Secure Wallet on the Xhavic Blockchain &mdash; the ultimate vault
            for your long-term holdings. Choose between instant composability and 24-hour
            reversibility within a single chain.
          </p>

          <!-- CTAs -->
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
            <a href="/whitepaper" class="btn-primary">Read the Whitepaper</a>
            <a href="/docs" class="btn bg-white/10 text-white border border-white/15 px-6 py-3 md:px-8 md:py-3.5 hover:bg-white/15 active:scale-[0.98]">
              Developer Integration
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: Hero preview cards -->
        <div class="space-y-5" data-reveal-stagger>
          <!-- Instant card -->
          <div class="card-dark-solid p-6" style="border-color: rgba(34, 98, 255, 0.2);">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center border border-primary/30">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Instant Wallet</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-primary font-semibold">&lt;200ms soft finality</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
              Composable, irreversible, built for DeFi speed. Trades, swaps, and liquidations execute at the pace the market demands.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Secure card -->
          <div class="card-dark-solid p-6" style="border-color: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.2);">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center border" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.15); border-color: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.3);">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6" style="color: #c4a35a;" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Secure Wallet</h3>
                <p class="text-sm font-semibold" style="color: #c4a35a;">24-hour protection window</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
              Cold-wallet grade security with a built-in safety net. Revert unauthorized transactions with a single click from your email.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================
       2. THE PROBLEM — section-compact editorial
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section-bordered" data-reveal>
    <div class="section-compact container">
      <span class="label-mono">THE PROBLEM</span>
      <h2 class="heading-section text-ink mt-4 mb-8">
        Your crypto shouldn't disappear<br class="hidden md:block"/> the moment it leaves your wallet.
      </h2>

      <!-- Pull quote -->
      <blockquote class="border-l-4 pl-6 py-2 my-10" style="border-color: #c4a35a;">
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-ink leading-snug italic">
          "Imagine a wallet that watches your back &mdash; one that gives you a chance to undo mistakes, stop theft, and protect your assets before it's too late."
        </p>
      </blockquote>

      <div class="prose-editorial">
        <p class="mb-4">
          Once a crypto transaction is sent, it's gone. There's no customer support to call,
          no bank to reverse the charge, no way to get it back. Whether it's an honest
          mistake or a malicious attack, the result is the same &mdash; your assets vanish instantly
          and irreversibly.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-4">
          Xhavic's Secure Wallet changes this. It places a 24-hour safety net between your
          assets and the outside world. Every outgoing transaction is held in escrow, and
          you're notified by email immediately. If something looks wrong, one click reverts
          the transaction &mdash; no private keys needed, no panic required.
        </p>
        <p class="font-semibold" style="color: #c4a35a;">
          It's like having a cold wallet with a built-in undo button.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================
       3. THE MECHANISM — 4-step flow with email/escrow
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section-bordered" data-reveal>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <span class="label-mono">THE MECHANISM</span>
        <h2 class="heading-section text-ink mt-4 mb-4">
          How Secure Wallet Protects You
        </h2>
        <p class="prose-editorial mx-auto" style="text-align: center; max-width: 640px;">
          Four simple steps between your assets and the outside world.
          No hardware wallet needed. No complex multi-sig setup.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 4-Step Flow -->
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-start">

        <!-- Left: Steps 1-4 -->
        <div class="space-y-0" data-reveal-stagger>
          <!-- Step 1 — Setup -->
          <div class="relative pl-16 pb-10">
            <!-- Connector line -->
            <div class="absolute left-[1.375rem] top-12 w-px h-full" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.2);"></div>
            <!-- Number circle -->
            <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 w-11 h-11 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center border-2" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.1); border-color: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.3);">
              <span class="text-sm font-bold" style="color: #c4a35a;">01</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">Setup</h3>
              <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Create a Secure Wallet in the Xhavic Wallet App and link your email address.
                That's it &mdash; your safety net is active from the first transaction.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Step 2 — The Safety Net -->
          <div class="relative pl-16 pb-10">
            <div class="absolute left-[1.375rem] top-12 w-px h-full" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.2);"></div>
            <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 w-11 h-11 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center border-2" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.1); border-color: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.3);">
              <span class="text-sm font-bold" style="color: #c4a35a;">02</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">The Safety Net</h3>
              <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
                When assets leave your Secure Wallet, they aren't transferred immediately.
                Instead, they're held in a transparent on-chain escrow for 24 hours.
                No one can touch them during this window.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Step 3 — Instant Notification -->
          <div class="relative pl-16 pb-10">
            <div class="absolute left-[1.375rem] top-12 w-px h-full" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.2);"></div>
            <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 w-11 h-11 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center border-2" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.1); border-color: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.3);">
              <span class="text-sm font-bold" style="color: #c4a35a;">03</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">Instant Notification</h3>
              <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
                You receive an email alert the moment any transaction is initiated from your
                Secure Wallet. The email includes full transaction details and a
                <strong class="text-ink">Revert Transaction</strong> link.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Step 4 — You Decide -->
          <div class="relative pl-16">
            <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 w-11 h-11 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center border-2" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.1); border-color: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.3);">
              <span class="text-sm font-bold" style="color: #c4a35a;">04</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">You Decide</h3>
              <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
                If everything looks right, do nothing &mdash; the funds release automatically after 24 hours.
                If something is wrong, click the revert link in your email and the transaction is
                cancelled immediately. Your assets return to your wallet.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: Flow Diagram -->
        <div class="flex justify-center">
          <div class="w-full max-w-sm">
            <!-- Wallet -->
            <div class="flex justify-center mb-5">
              <div class="card-arch px-6 py-4 text-center w-full" style="border-color: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.25);">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full mx-auto mb-2 flex items-center justify-center" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.12);">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5" style="color: #c4a35a;" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"/>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <p class="text-sm font-bold text-ink">Secure Wallet</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted">Outgoing transaction initiated</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Connector -->
            <div class="flex justify-center mb-5">
              <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
                <div class="w-px h-6" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.3);"></div>
                <svg class="w-3 h-3" style="color: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.4);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 12 12">
                  <path d="M6 9L1 4h10L6 9z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Escrow -->
            <div class="flex justify-center mb-5">
              <div class="w-full rounded-xl p-5 text-center border-2 border-dashed" style="border-color: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.3); background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.04);">
                <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold mb-3" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.15); color: #c4a35a;">
                  <svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
                  </svg>
                  24-HOUR ESCROW
                </div>
                <p class="text-sm font-bold text-ink mb-1">Funds Held Securely</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted">On-chain escrow &bull; Transparent &bull; Immutable</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Email notification branch -->
            <div class="flex justify-center mb-5">
              <div class="card-arch px-5 py-3 text-center w-full" style="border-color: rgba(34, 98, 255, 0.2);">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/>
                  </svg>
                  <p class="text-sm font-bold text-ink">Email Alert Sent</p>
                </div>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">Includes "Revert Transaction" link</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Branch connector -->
            <div class="relative h-8 mb-5">
              <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 w-px h-3 -translate-x-px" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.3);"></div>
              <div class="absolute top-3 left-[15%] right-[15%] h-px" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.2);"></div>
              <div class="absolute left-[15%] top-3 w-px h-5 bg-emerald-400/50"></div>
              <div class="absolute right-[15%] top-3 w-px h-5 bg-red-400/50"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Two outcomes -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
              <!-- Do nothing -->
              <div class="rounded-lg border p-4 text-center bg-emerald-50/50" style="border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-2">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <p class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-700 mb-1">Do Nothing</p>
                <p class="text-[10px] text-muted leading-tight">Funds release automatically after 24h</p>
              </div>

              <!-- Click revert -->
              <div class="rounded-lg border p-4 text-center bg-red-50/50" style="border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2);">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-red-100 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-2">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-red-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 10h10a8 8 0 018 8v2M3 10l6 6m-6-6l6-6"/>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <p class="text-xs font-bold text-red-700 mb-1">Click Revert</p>
                <p class="text-[10px] text-muted leading-tight">Transaction cancelled, assets returned</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================
       4. INSTANT WALLET — section-bordered + heading-accent-blue
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section-bordered" data-reveal>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-40-60">
        <!-- Left: Content -->
        <div>
          <span class="label-mono">INSTANT WALLET</span>
          <div class="heading-accent-blue mt-4">
            <h2 class="heading-section text-ink">Instant Wallet</h2>
          </div>

          <p class="prose-editorial mt-6 mb-8">
            The Instant Wallet is designed for speed-critical operations where composability
            is non-negotiable. Transactions achieve soft finality in under 200 milliseconds,
            making them immediately available for downstream contract execution.
          </p>

          <ul class="space-y-4">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-ink font-semibold">Full DeFi composability</p>
                <p class="text-muted text-sm">Other contracts can immediately build on transaction outputs.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-ink font-semibold">Irreversible by design</p>
                <p class="text-muted text-sm">Composability requires deterministic finality. No reversal mechanism exists.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-ink font-semibold">Ethereum settlement in ~13 minutes</p>
                <p class="text-muted text-sm">Standard L1 settlement after sequencer confirmation.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-ink font-semibold">Built for DeFi, liquidations, and AI agents</p>
                <p class="text-muted text-sm">Token swaps, perpetual futures, arbitrage, and automated strategies.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: Spec card -->
        <div class="flex justify-center items-center">
          <div class="card-arch w-full max-w-sm" style="border-color: rgba(34, 98, 255, 0.2);">
            <h3 class="label-mono text-primary mb-6">Key Specifications</h3>
            <div class="space-y-5">
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-4 border-b border-gray-100">
                <span class="text-muted text-sm">Soft Finality</span>
                <span class="text-ink font-bold text-lg">&lt;200ms</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-4 border-b border-gray-100">
                <span class="text-muted text-sm">Composable</span>
                <span class="text-primary font-bold">Yes</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-4 border-b border-gray-100">
                <span class="text-muted text-sm">Reversible</span>
                <span class="text-red-500 font-bold">No</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-4 border-b border-gray-100">
                <span class="text-muted text-sm">L1 Settlement</span>
                <span class="text-ink font-bold">~13 min</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                <span class="text-muted text-sm">Security Model</span>
                <span class="text-ink font-bold">Speed-optimized</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================
       5. SECURE WALLET — section-bordered + heading-accent-gold
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section-bordered" data-reveal>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-40-60">
        <!-- Left: Spec card -->
        <div class="flex justify-center items-center">
          <div class="card-arch w-full max-w-sm" style="border-color: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.2);">
            <h3 class="label-mono mb-6" style="color: #c4a35a;">Key Specifications</h3>
            <div class="space-y-5">
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-4 border-b border-gray-100">
                <span class="text-muted text-sm">Escrow Period</span>
                <span class="text-ink font-bold text-lg">24 hours</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-4 border-b border-gray-100">
                <span class="text-muted text-sm">Composable</span>
                <span class="font-bold" style="color: #c4a35a;">No (until final)</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-4 border-b border-gray-100">
                <span class="text-muted text-sm">Reversible</span>
                <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">Yes &mdash; via email link</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-4 border-b border-gray-100">
                <span class="text-muted text-sm">Notification</span>
                <span class="text-ink font-bold">Email alert</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                <span class="text-muted text-sm">Security Model</span>
                <span class="text-ink font-bold">Cold-wallet grade</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: Content -->
        <div>
          <span class="label-mono">SECURE WALLET</span>
          <div class="heading-accent-gold mt-4">
            <h2 class="heading-section text-ink">Why Move Your Assets to Secure Wallet</h2>
          </div>

          <p class="prose-editorial mt-6 mb-8">
            Secure Wallet gives you the robust security of a cold wallet without the hardware,
            the complexity, or the risk of losing a device. Your long-term holdings stay
            protected by a 24-hour escrow and real-time email alerts &mdash; all on-chain.
          </p>

          <ul class="space-y-4">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #c4a35a;"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-ink font-semibold">Cold Storage Security</p>
                <p class="text-muted text-sm">The robust security of a cold wallet without a hardware device. Your assets are protected at the protocol level.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #c4a35a;"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-ink font-semibold">24-Hour Revert Window</p>
                <p class="text-muted text-sm">Stop any outgoing transaction within 24 hours. One click from your email is all it takes to cancel and recover your funds.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #c4a35a;"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-ink font-semibold">Escrow Protection</p>
                <p class="text-muted text-sm">Funds are held in a transparent on-chain escrow stage. No quick getaway for attackers &mdash; there is always time to act.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #c4a35a;"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-ink font-semibold">Real-Time Alerts</p>
                <p class="text-muted text-sm">Immediate email notifications for any movement from your Secure Wallet. You're always in the loop, always in control.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================
       6. COMPARISON TABLE — section-inset dark, data table
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section-inset" data-reveal>
    <div class="container max-w-4xl">
      <span class="label-mono-dark">COMPARISON</span>
      <h2 class="heading-section mt-4 mb-4">Side-by-Side Comparison</h2>
      <p class="prose-editorial-dark mb-10">
        Each wallet type serves a distinct operational profile. Here is how they compare.
      </p>

      <!-- Table header -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-3">
        <div class="py-3 px-4">
          <p class="label-mono-dark">Feature</p>
        </div>
        <div class="py-3 px-4 text-center rounded-t-lg bg-primary/10 border-t-2 border-primary">
          <p class="text-sm font-bold text-primary uppercase tracking-wider">Instant Wallet</p>
        </div>
        <div class="py-3 px-4 text-center rounded-t-lg border-t-2" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.1); border-color: #c4a35a;">
          <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider" style="color: #c4a35a;">Secure Wallet</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Rows -->
      <div class="space-y-2" data-reveal-stagger>
        <!-- Soft Finality -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 items-center">
